WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.701 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.202
-Anyway, I know I spend
a lot of time

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.004
defending SeaWorld,
but they really do

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.505
a terrific job with the fish.

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:08.140
-Cool.
-Here's the check,

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.308
whenever you're ready.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.477
No rush.
-He was great, by the way.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.746
I think we tip him, right?

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:16.149
-Okay.
So, um, how should we do this?

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.650
-I mean, I guess
I could put it on my card.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.719
-No, no, no. You don't --
You don't have to do that.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.888
-If it's easier,
we can just split it six ways.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.290
-Well, I mean, some people
had more than others.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.658
-Did they?
-But let's just go through

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.993
and see who ordered what.
-Okay. That's fair.

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:29.195
-Diet Coke.
-That's me.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.097
-Coke Zero.
-That's me.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.932
-Sprite Zero.
-Me, as well.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.000
Just obeying my thirst.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.903
-Iced tea?
-Me.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.637
-Arnold Palmer.
-Moi.

00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:41.307
-Arnold Palmer with tequila.
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.509
Someone had to get
the party started.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:47.179
-Whole roasted chicken,
extra potatoes.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.847
-Sounds familiar.

00:00:48.847 --> 00:00:52.952
-Flat-iron pork chops,
sub out broccoli for potatoes.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.353
-Okay, no, no, no, no.
Wait.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:55.988
That I ordered for the table,

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:59.926
although I probably did eat
the lion's share of it.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:02.728
-98-ounce porterhouse steak.

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:05.731
-Okay. Don't look at me,
'cause I did not get that.

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.401
I'm serious.
I didn't get that.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.003
There's no way.
Come on.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.439
-There's a photo of you
on the wall, eating it.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:16.542
-Well, maybe.
-Four bacon cheeseburgers to-go.

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:19.779
-Okay, I'm off the hot seat.
Bob, that's you.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:23.149
-I'm a vegetarian.
-A little too much information.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:27.320
-The Carson Daly,
a chicken broth and vodka.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.221
-Yeah, I was trying
to switch it up.

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:32.625
A man cannot
live on tequila alone.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.928
-"Five shots of tequila,
but leave them in the bathroom

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:37.563
so my friends don't find out"?

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:40.567
-Yeah, I'm actually more
concerned you called us friends.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:43.603
-A dozen raw eggs,
still in the container.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:47.540
-That, I'll admit,
was a little grocery shopping.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.209
And I don't expect you guys
to pay for that.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:52.879
-A bottle of your nicest white
wine with a note that says,

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:57.617
"Please take me back, Jennifer.
I am so, so, so sorry.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.918
I know we can make this work

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.053
if you just tell
the judge you were lying."

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:04.490
-They wrote that on the bill?
Just to embarrass me?

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:07.093
-No, they charged you
because you asked for it

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.962
to be done by a calligrapher.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:11.297
-It's beautiful.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.000
-Bowl of turkey chili
with a rum floater.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.469
-"Did I do that?"
Urkel.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.538
-Another small side of potatoes.

00:02:19.538 --> 00:02:22.474
-That actually was me.
Those potatoes did look good.

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:24.610
-And a Cadillac margarita?

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:26.646
Hey, it's 5:00 A.M.
somewhere, right?

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.114
-A.M.?
-Is anyone else

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.049
really blacking out right now?

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.283
[ Hand raps table ]

00:02:31.283 --> 00:02:34.954
-Mr. Jackie
St. Croix St. Thomas,

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:36.589
we invited you to this meeting

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:38.524
because you said
you uncovered a map

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:42.195
that would show us the true
location of the Holy Grail.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:45.298
-We've been more than patient
with you.

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.433
Now produce the map at once.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:50.769
-There are interested parties --

00:02:50.769 --> 00:02:54.473
Nazis -- who are
most eager to possess it.

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:56.375
-All right, I'm just
gonna come clean.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:58.711
I'm not the successful dentist
turned janitor

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.079
turned influencer
you all thought I was,

00:03:01.079 --> 00:03:04.183
and I don't have the map.

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:06.819
Because it belongs in a museum.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.487
[ "Raiders March" plays ]

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.422
[ All gasp ]
-It's him!

00:03:10.422 --> 00:03:13.425
-Dr. Indianapolis Bones?!

00:03:13.425 --> 00:03:14.794
[ Whip cracks ]

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:20.200
-Not so fast, Dr. Bones.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.101
-Nothing my trusty whip
can't hand--

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.170
[ Gunshot, body thuds ]

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.939
Ohh!
You killed him!

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:31.143
You kill Dr. Bones...
in the first episode?

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:32.412
Only on Amazon Prime.

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:34.614
We're still figuring it out.

